OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVictims and veterans keeping close
OL,4,Awatch on Troubles legacy bill debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking in the Commons on Monday
OL,7,Fnight, Northern Ireland secretary Sir
OL,8,FChris Bryant said thousands of families
OL,9,Fimpacted by the Troubles have had to
OL,10,Fwait "far too long to get their
OL,11,Fanswers".
OL,13,FFor people like Patricia Burns, whose
OL,14,Ffather was shot dead by a soldier, and
OL,15,FDavid Crabbe, who served in the Ulster
OL,16,FDefence Regiment during the Troubles,
OL,17,Fthe debate in the Commons is especially
OL,18,Fimportant.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
